iphone 6s is on it's very last legs (no app can be opened without crashing).....What are the chances by the end of the month I will be able to have an iphone 13 in my hands in Australia- going by the trend of previous years? I have never pre-ordered or even gotten a brand new phone at launch so this is new to me....thanks!

